{{Otheruses|def=no|the mountain guide in Varlamore|Mountain Guide (Auburn Valley)}}

The '''Mountain Guide''' is found with the [[Varrock Museum]] expedition on [[Mount Quidamortem]], along with the [[Natural Historian (Mount Quidamortem)|Natural Historian]], [[Historian Duffy]], and [[Gnosi]]. He is able to take players back and forth between Mount Quidamortem, [[Shayziens' Wall]], and south of Mount Quidamortem.

When players reach the summit, find the Mountain Guide and speak with him to unlock a travel point between the mountain, the Wall, and south of Quidamortem. This will save a considerable amount of time and avoids monsters on the way to the mountain. 

To quickly reach the top, use a [[Games necklace]] to travel to the [[Wintertodt Camp|Wintertodt camp]], use the [[Lovakengj Minecart Network]] to travel to Mount Quidamortem, and run east. Once unlocked, you can quickly reach the Mountain Guide in numerous ways.

* Use the [[Xeric's talisman]] to teleport to Xeric's Honour (if unlocked using the [[ancient tablet]]), and walk east
* Use [[Fairy rings|fairy ring]] code {{fairycode|BLS}} and run south-west
* Use [[Book of the Dead#Teleportation|Book of the Dead's]] teleport option, [[History and Hearsay]], then run south-west
* Use [[Ring of shadows]]' teleport option, [[The Stranglewood]] (if unlocked using the [[strangled tablet]]), run to the rowboat on the north-east of the forest, take it, and run east

